          {
            "code": "\n\ta \u003d value[\u0027tagInfo\u0027][\u0027availability\u0027] or 0.0\n\tp \u003d value[\u0027tagInfo\u0027][\u0027performance\u0027]  or 0.0\n\tq \u003d value[\u0027tagInfo\u0027][\u0027quality\u0027]  or 0.0\n\toee \u003d a * p * q\t\n\t\n\tparamsDict \u003d {\u0027assetPath\u0027 : self.params.value.assetInfo.assetPath or \u0027none\u0027}\n\tif self.custom.oeeThresholds: paramsDict[\u0027oeeThresholds\u0027] \u003d self.custom.oeeThresholds\n\toeeColors \u003d system.kanoa.event.getOEEColors(paramsDict, oee, a, p, q)\n\t\t\n\treturn {\u0027availability\u0027: oeeColors[\u0027availability\u0027], \u0027performance\u0027: oeeColors[\u0027performance\u0027], \u0027quality\u0027: oeeColors[\u0027quality\u0027], \u0027oee\u0027: oeeColors[\u0027oee\u0027]}",
